    "title": "Methoden überschreiben",
    "descriptionContent": "Möchtest du dasselbe Verhalten in der Unterklasse, aber leicht unterschiedliche Ergebnisse? Überschreiben ist der Schlüssel.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17689,
        "title": "Methodenüberschreibung",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Angenommen, wir entwickeln ein einfaches Arcade-Spiel mit einem grundlegenden Gegner und einem stärkeren Boss-Gegner. Bosse sind spezielle Gegner mit unterschiedlichem Verhalten.</p><p>Da kommt das <strong>Methodenüberschreiben</strong> ins Spiel.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können eine <code>Enemy</code>-Klasse erstellen und eine <code>Boss</code>-Klasse davon ableiten.</p><p>Dann können wir durch Methodenüberschreibung das Schadensverhalten der <code>Boss</code>-Klasse ändern.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Überschreiben einer Methode ersetzt den Code der Methode in der Superklasse durch den der Subklasse.</p><p>Rufe die <code>takeHit()</code>-Methode aus der <code>Boss</code>-Klasse auf, um zu sehen, was mit der <code>hp</code>-Eigenschaft passiert.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"256\" /><option startIndex=\"256\" endIndex=\"257\" /><option startIndex=\"257\" endIndex=\"266\" /><option startIndex=\"266\" endIndex=\"267\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>boss</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>takeHit()</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um eine Methode zu überschreiben, geben wir ihr den <em>gleichen</em> Namen und die gleichen Parameter wie der Methode in der Superklasse.</p><p>Wir können <code>takeHit()</code> von der Superklasse überschreiben, indem wir die gleiche Methode in der Subklasse programmieren.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"162\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>takeHit()</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überschreiben bedeutet, dass wir die <em>gleiche Methode</em> in der Unterklasse haben können, aber ihr Verhalten für das, was in der Unterklasse benötigt wird, <em>anpassen</em> können.</p><p>Wenn wir die <code>takeHit()</code>-Methode auf <code>enemy</code> und <code>boss</code> aufrufen, werden wir ihr ähnliches Verhalten, aber unterschiedliche Ergebnisse sehen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"238\" /><option startIndex=\"239\" endIndex=\"248\" /><option startIndex=\"308\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"313\" endIndex=\"322\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(sprite) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".sprite = sprite;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeHit() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp - \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.hp);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;boss.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.takeHit();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boss.hp);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>enemy</code>, gefolgt von <code>takeHit()</code> und schließlich <code>boss</code>, <code>takeHit()</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn wir das Verhalten der Methode der Superklasse benötigen, können wir sie mit dem <code>super</code>-Schlüsselwort aufrufen.</p><p>Gib das richtige Schlüsselwort ein, um die <code>attack()</code>-Methode aus der Enemy-Klasse aufzurufen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"196\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>super</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Beim Überschreiben können wir auf dem Verhalten der Unterklasse aufbauen. Nachdem ein normaler Angriff ausgeführt wurde, kann ein Boss einen Spezialzug auslösen.</p><p>Füge boss-spezifisches Verhalten zur <code>Boss</code>-Klasse in der <code>attack()</code>-Methode hinzu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"209\" endIndex=\"220\" /><option startIndex=\"221\" endIndex=\"243\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(weapon) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon = weapon;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy attacks with &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".weapon);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"super\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".attack();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss uses Mega Slam!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boss = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"&quot;claws&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"boss.attack();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>console.log</code>, gefolgt von <code>\"Boss uses Mega Slam!\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum möchten wir, dass eine Methode in einer Unterklasse eine Methode aus einer Oberklasse überschreibt?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Um die Methode in der Unterklasse anzupassen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Um die Methode der Superklasse für Unterklassen zu ändern</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Um die Methode in der Unterklasse anzupassen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was muss die Subklassenmethode mit der Superklassenmethode gemeinsam haben, wenn sie überschrieben wird?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Name und die Parameter</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Der Methodenrumpf</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Name und die Parameter.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überschreibt die Methode in der <code>Bat</code>-Klasse die Methode der <code>Enemy</code>-Klasse?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Bat\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" bite(target) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (target === \" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hit &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + target);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nein, es hat einen anderen Namen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ja, es hat denselben Parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nein, es hat einen anderen Namen.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Schlüsselwort verwenden wir, wenn wir die Methode einer Superklasse in der Subklasse aufrufen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>this</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>super</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kann eine Unterklasse die ursprüngliche Methode der Oberklasse noch verwenden, nachdem sie diese überschrieben hat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nein, wenn diese Methode ohne <code>super</code> mit ihrem Namen aufgerufen wird, verwendet die Unterklasse die überschreibende Methode</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ja, die Unterklasse verwendet standardmäßig die Methode der Oberklasse, selbst nach dem Überschreiben</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nein, wenn diese Methode ohne <code>super</code> mit ihrem Namen aufgerufen wird, verwendet die Unterklasse die überschreibende Methode.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Überschreibe <code>draw()</code> aus der Superklasse, indem du dieselbe Methode in der Subklasse codierst.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"157\" endIndex=\"158\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>draw</code>, gefolgt von <code>()</code> und schließlich <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 150046,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die <code>draw()</code>-Methode auf der <code>AnimatedSprite</code>-Instanz auf, um zu sehen, was passiert.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"200\" endIndex=\"215\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mySprite = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mySprite.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>mySprite.draw()</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 150047,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die <code>draw()</code>-Methode auf <code>sprite1</code> und <code>sprite2</code> auf, um ihr unterschiedliches Verhalten zu sehen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"191\" endIndex=\"198\" /><option startIndex=\"198\" endIndex=\"206\" /><option startIndex=\"245\" endIndex=\"252\" /><option startIndex=\"252\" endIndex=\"260\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Drawing sprite.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AnimatedSprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sprite\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" draw() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing animation frames.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Sprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite1.draw();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sprite2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" AnimatedSprite();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sprite2.draw();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>sprite1</code>, gefolgt von <code>.draw();</code> und schließlich <code>sprite2</code>, <code>.draw();</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 150048,
